        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If only I could figure out how to get bipedal crocheted figures to stand up.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Tiny wires that go up into the body, and hooks for crocheted bases? I dunno I wish I did some sort of fiber art instead of only working in clay.</p>",
